# Headless tour of the gauge (cargo xtask sim-smoke): move the keypad focus to the load gauge
# and back to the setpoint gauge (focus ring), step it up three times and down once (the needle
# moves), let the load gauge cross its alarm threshold, then cycle the theme modes with F12
# (dark, night, high contrast).
wait 500
shot initial
key Next
key Next
key Right
key Right
key Right
key Left
wait 500
shot setpoint_23
wait 6000
shot load_alarm
hotkey F12
wait 200
shot dark
hotkey F12
wait 200
shot night
hotkey F12
wait 200
shot high_contrast
